        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Herbert Achternbusch, David Seltzer, Michael Douglas, Melanie Griffith, Liam Neeson, Joely Richardson, John Gielgud\n- Films: Hades, Shining Through, The Omen, Bird on a Wire\n- Roles: writer, painter, filmmaker, screenwriter, producer, director, actor\n\nFacts:\n- Herbert Achternbusch was born on 23 November 1938 in Munich and is a German writer, painter, and filmmaker.\n- David Seltzer was born in 1940 and is an American screenwriter, producer, and director.\n- David Seltzer wrote the screenplays for The Omen (1976) and Bird on a Wire (1990).\n- Shining Through is an American World War II drama film that was released in the United States on January 31, 1992.\n- David Seltzer wrote and directed Shining Through.\n- Shining Through stars Michael Douglas and Melanie Griffith, with Liam Neeson, Joely Richardson, and John Gielgud in supporting roles.\n- Hades is a 1995 German drama film directed by Herbert Achternbusch and starring Herbert Achternbusch.",
